      "comment": "TERRIFIC BAZ (1) hit the ground running from out wide with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 1.75 lengths fourth (23.08) over 400m at this track. Has winning claims on his best figures. ASTON TYPHOON (2) steps out for the first time at this course. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 6 lengths (22.40) at Broken Hill. The form from his last run stacks up well. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ALLINGA MERCURY (4) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (19.90) at Angle Park in a Other over 342m. Overdue and is among the main hopes. DEEP PURPLE (8) can sneak into the finish again.",
